# Gimnasio Planta (C4a, contract 39), 14 x 18, interior. column = i, row = j. The user's mock "Gimnasio Planta": a GREENHOUSE: white glass walls in dark frames on the back sides (glass_j / glass_i), a flower
# meadow floor with plain light-soil paths (soil_a / soil_b), planters and flowerbeds. Four trainers (three lasses and a medium) guard the hall and FLORA NYX (flora; Dewlash 29, Mossbloom 24, Bloomoss 29) waits at the
# far end; the camera cuts to her. A win: flag 83 = Medalla Raiz (builtin `badge_raiz`), the trainer card's 4th badge (a leaf), Disc 05 (flag 76). The entrance is a pocket closed by a cuttable bush outside (metropolis_neon_2).
@map gimnasio_neon
@size 14 18
@interior yes
@bg 0
@fill flowers
@spawn door 6 16 N
@flag flora_disc 76
@legend
  .  tile=flowers
  a  tile=none object=glass_j
  b  tile=none object=glass_i
  c  object=planter
  d  object=flowerbed
  e  npc=flora id=flora face=S script=flora
  f  tile=soil
  g  npc=chica id=t1 face=S trainer=chica_g1 range=3 text=tr.chica_g1.pre after=tr.chica_g1.after
  h  npc=chica id=t2 face=W trainer=chica_g2 range=3 text=tr.chica_g2.pre after=tr.chica_g2.after
  i  npc=chica id=t3 face=S trainer=chica_g3 range=3 text=tr.chica_g3.pre after=tr.chica_g3.after
  j  npc=medium id=t4 face=W trainer=medium_g range=3 text=tr.medium_g.pre after=tr.medium_g.after
  k  tile=mat
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  b.............
  b..cd.e.dc....
  b.....ff..c...
  b..c..ff...c..
  b..g..ff.d....
  b.....ff..h...
  b...c.ff......
  b.ffffffffff..
  b.....ff......
  b.d.d.ff...c..
  b..i..ff.d....
  b.....ff..j...
  b.ffffffffff..
  b.....ff......
  b.c..dffc..d..
  b.....ff......
  b.....kk......
@warp k -> metropolis_neon_2 spawn=gym_door
# Flora Nyx. Before the badge: the camera cuts to her, her challenge, the fight (trainer flora: Dewlash 29, Mossbloom 24, Bloomoss 29); a win = her speech, the Medalla Raiz (flag 83, the trainer card's
# 4th badge, a leaf), what it is, then Disc 05 (a full bag keeps flora_disc clear and she hands it over the next time you talk to her). A loss is the blackout. Afterwards a last line.
@script flora npc
    jf badge_raiz after
    npc_face_hero flora
    cam_npc flora
    say gym.flora.pre
    battle 76 0
    jv 0 1 won
    blackout
    end
  won:
    say gym.flora.win
    setf badge_raiz
    say gym.badge
    say gym.flora.about
    call flora_gift
    cam_hero
    end
  after:
    npc_face_hero flora
    cam_npc flora
    jf flora_disc said
    call flora_gift
    cam_hero
    end
  said:
    say gym.flora.after
    cam_hero
@end
@script flora_gift called
    say gym.flora.disc
    give_item disc_05 1
    jv 0 0 full
    item_var 0 disc_05
    say gl.gift
    setf flora_disc
    say gym.flora.disc_about
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
@end
